"profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10835,"location":"US","published_at":"2012-10-20T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"ryl92WNe9i0","position":43,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jesse Boykins III - Nectar(Freestyle)","track":{"id":"AwE7FkpLNk8","path":"/artists/jesse-boykins-iii/tracks/nectar-freestyle/","slug":"nectar-freestyle","title":"Nectar (Freestyle)","artist":{"slug":"jesse-boykins-iii","title":"Jesse Boykins III"},"artwork":"images/artists/jesse-boykins-iii/tracks/nectar-freestyle.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"vPfL7UzxY4Y","slug":"139","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-139-w-dj"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #139 w/ DJ Harrison","artwork":"/images/episodes/139.jpg","content":"DJ Harrison thows down a crazy live improvised session with the SP-404 and MPC1000\n\n<!--more-->\n\noe Kay started off with some nice deep/melodic tracks from Mr. Carmack, Christoph El Truento, Dirg Gerner, Iamnobodi, Sango, Last Night In Paris, Geode and many more! Joe took it back to the essence with Ginuwine/Timbaland/Dilla classics! DJ Harrison on the other hand who reminds us of Madlib (no really he does)all the way from Virginia threw down a crazy live session with the SP-404 & MPC 1000. Lots of soulful chops and intricate drum patterns! This is another amazing session from start to finish! Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10810,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-03T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"JkAiUl_i2WQ","position":26,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jesse Boykins III - Amorous","track":{"id":"x-oOKKbjwzg","path":"/artists/jesse-boykins-iii/tracks/amorous/","slug":"amorous","title":"Amorous","artist":{"slug":"jesse-boykins-iii","title":"Jesse Boykins III"},"artwork":"images/artists/jesse-boykins-iii/tracks/amorous.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PQcEHD74TwM","slug":"141","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-141-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #141 w/ Colta (Team Supreme)","artwork":"/images/episodes/141.jpg","content":"\nColta from Team Supreme drops a set to promote the (Team Supreme x Soulection Takeover @ The Echo)\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10821,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-17T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"8Sv3TaCrYf4","position":19,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jesse Boykins III - Nectar(Freestyle)","track":{"id":"AwE7FkpLNk8","path":"/artists/jesse-boykins-iii/tracks/nectar-freestyle/","slug":"nectar-freestyle","title":"Nectar (Freestyle)","artist":{"slug":"jesse-boykins-iii","title":"Jesse Boykins III"},"artwork":"images/artists/jesse-boykins-iii/tracks/nectar-freestyle.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"UMjXwUAv27s","slug":"148","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-148"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #148","artwork":"/images/episodes/148.jpg","content":"\nContinuing Joe Kay's 24th birthday celibration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nIn celebration of Joe's 24th birthday yesterday, we started celebrating on Thursday at The Sound of Tomorrow (The Crosby) with Astronautica & starRo! Thank you to everyone who came out and supported, what a show it was. This radio session is just a continuation of the celebration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard. \nBless to those who tuned into the live broadcast via Kbeach. It's amazing to think about how far we've came. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n